00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:10.797
an indictment of the former president?

00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:13.666
I think it's highly likely.

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.168
All the signs point that way.

00:07:15.168 --> 00:07:17.703
The evidence is certainly overwhelming.

00:07:17.703 --> 00:07:18.771
What I'm curious is,

00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:20.072
is whether they offer him

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:22.141
a deal in the documents case.

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:23.643
That's the norm

00:07:23.643 --> 00:07:24.477
with high level

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:26.312
people who violate the law

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:27.480
and get themselves in trouble

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.916
with security clearances.

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:32.118
But I don't know if even Donald Trump

00:07:32.118 --> 00:07:34.320
would take a deal if he was offered one.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:35.721
John Dean, appreciate it.

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:37.156
Leonid Galen, thanks very much.

00:07:37.156 --> 00:07:37.924
Kayleigh is going to be back

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:39.125
at the top of the hour for CNN.

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.294
Prime time at 9 p.m. with more.

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:41.761
Joining us now,

00:07:41.761 --> 00:07:43.029
CNN senior political commentator,

00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:43.563
former Illinois

00:07:43.563 --> 00:07:44.664
Republican congressman and former

00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:46.833
January six select committee member

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:48.468
Adam Kinzinger.

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:49.502
Congressman I'm wondering what

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:51.304
your reaction to this revelation of

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:52.472
a Florida grand jury is.

00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:55.174
Yeah, I mean, it's

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:58.110
of all the possibilities, I'm as confused

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.245
as anyone You know,

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:00.513
I think it's quite possible

00:08:00.513 --> 00:08:01.481
that maybe the D.C.

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:02.081
grand jury

00:08:02.081 --> 00:08:03.716
is focusing on things

00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:04.150
maybe more

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.052
related to January 6th or whatever

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:06.519
the D.C.

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:09.455
connection is to the documents. Case.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:10.823
And they're resting.

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.558
It seems like they haven't met recently.

00:08:12.558 --> 00:08:14.660
And Florida may be again,

00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:15.895
because you according

00:08:15.895 --> 00:08:16.629
to the Sixth Amendment,

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:17.430
you have to give somebody

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.731
an opportunity in their own area.

00:08:18.731 --> 00:08:19.265
And particularly

00:08:19.265 --> 00:08:21.167
if the crime was only committed

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:21.767
down there.

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:22.268
But, you know,

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:22.635
the one thing

00:08:22.635 --> 00:08:23.970
I'm hoping is that it's not,

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.338
in essence, a restart.

00:08:25.338 --> 00:08:27.106
It doesn't seem like that.

00:08:27.106 --> 00:08:27.874
But, yeah,

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.141
I think it's as confusing to me

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:30.343
as it has to anybody else.

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:31.377
You were obviously on the January

00:08:31.377 --> 00:08:31.911
six committee.

00:08:31.911 --> 00:08:33.446
I'm wondering what your thoughts are on

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:34.380
Mark Meadows.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.982
We now know he's reportedly already

00:08:35.982 --> 00:08:37.984
testified to a federal grand jury.

00:08:37.984 --> 00:08:39.151
Do we don't know when we don't know

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:40.019
exactly what he said

00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:41.220
or which line of inquiry,

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.555
whether classified documents

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:44.490
or January six or what it may have been?

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:47.894
Well, look, Anderson, this is huge.

00:08:47.894 --> 00:08:50.796
And I heard Ellie saying earlier about,

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:51.998
you know, text messages

00:08:51.998 --> 00:08:52.598
and everything else.

00:08:52.598 --> 00:08:54.567
Let me say this. Be very clear.

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:57.303
Had we not gotten the first tranche

00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:58.271
of Mark Meadows

00:08:58.271 --> 00:08:59.272
text messages

00:08:59.272 --> 00:09:01.440
on the January 6th committee,

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.543
it would have been much harder for us

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:05.211
to get to the answers

00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:06.412
that we eventually got to.

00:09:06.412 --> 00:09:07.013
He turned over

00:09:07.013 --> 00:09:08.281
an initial tranche of text

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:08.781
and then he quit

00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:10.082
cooperating with the committee.

00:09:10.082 --> 00:09:11.684
But in that initial tranche,

00:09:11.684 --> 00:09:13.085
we saw the text with,

00:09:13.085 --> 00:09:14.253
you know, the Fox News host.

00:09:14.253 --> 00:09:16.522
We saw the text with members of Congress

00:09:16.522 --> 00:09:18.524
and other actors that allowed us

00:09:18.524 --> 00:09:20.760
then to be able to connect dots.

00:09:20.793 --> 00:09:22.595
He was really the all star

00:09:22.595 --> 00:09:23.396
on that committee

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:24.964
in terms of the evidence provided.

00:09:24.964 --> 00:09:26.299
So if he now goes in

00:09:26.299 --> 00:09:27.800
front of a grand jury

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.169
and is fully cooperative,

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:30.736
I got to tell you,

00:09:30.736 --> 00:09:31.804
I mean, the stuff we got from him

00:09:31.804 --> 00:09:33.172
will pale in comparison

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:34.607
to a truthful testimony

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:36.442
by him in front of a grand jury.

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:37.543
Ellie was lounging here

00:09:37.543 --> 00:09:38.444
while you were talking.

00:09:38.477 --> 00:09:40.212
He's actually which is back with us.

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:41.747
I want to ask you, Ellie.

00:09:41.747 --> 00:09:42.181
John Dean

00:09:42.181 --> 00:09:43.816
mentioned the idea of a deal

00:09:43.816 --> 00:09:45.351
for the former president.

00:09:45.351 --> 00:09:47.353
What what how what would that entail?

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:47.520
Yeah.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.721
So there's a couple things

00:09:48.721 --> 00:09:50.556
that that could be that could mean

00:09:50.556 --> 00:09:51.991
he took a guilty plea

00:09:51.991 --> 00:09:53.526
and in exchange is testifying

00:09:53.526 --> 00:09:54.794
and hoping to get a reduced sentence.

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:56.262
That's sort of your standard

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:57.296
cooperator deal.

00:09:57.296 --> 00:09:58.531
But they would have to know

00:09:58.531 --> 00:09:59.398
that Mark Meadows

00:09:59.398 --> 00:10:01.133
actually committed a crime.

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:01.834
The other option,

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:03.469
the sort of less serious version of

00:10:03.469 --> 00:10:04.704
that is what I talked about before,

00:10:04.704 --> 00:10:06.472
the immunity deal, meaning

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:07.873
we're going to give you a free pass,

00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:08.474
not going to make you

00:10:08.474 --> 00:10:09.842
plead guilty to a crime,

00:10:09.842 --> 00:10:10.576
but we're not going to use

00:10:10.576 --> 00:10:11.877
your testimony against you.

00:10:11.877 --> 00:10:13.479
And now you have to testify carefully

00:10:13.479 --> 00:10:15.047
and to the point that Representative

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:17.116
Kinzinger is making that so important is

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.618
Meadows did cooperate with the test

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:20.119
when he gave them that dynamic,

00:10:21.354 --> 00:10:22.822
all his text, which were remarkable.

00:10:22.822 --> 00:10:24.090
But then he stopped

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.157
cooperating with the committee

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:26.392
sort of midstream

00:10:26.392 --> 00:10:28.394
and so left a lot hanging out there.

00:10:28.394 --> 00:10:28.861
And Adam,

00:10:28.861 --> 00:10:29.729
as Adam correctly,

00:10:29.729 --> 00:10:30.696
says, prosecutors are going to

00:10:30.696 --> 00:10:31.631
be able to get all of that.

